+    // THREADS: the profile's action buttons (ProfileActionsView), two of them: "Go to message" and "Mute"/"Unmute".
+    // A copy of its drawing, because its buttons are a fixed set: 14dp sides, 7dp between, 8dp top, 12dp bottom,
